&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT TO EXPECT:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Phiture is looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Senior ASO Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; to join the team, report to the &lt;strong&gt;Growth Lead&lt;/strong&gt; and partner closely with some of our &lt;strong&gt;most important clients&lt;/strong&gt;. You’ll sit at the heart of our multidisciplinary marketing team, and the role goes well past day-to-day client management: you’ll &lt;strong&gt;run client projects, coach colleagues, and build strategies&lt;/strong&gt; grounded in user behaviour, experimentation and growth that clients can measure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive &lt;strong&gt;ASO and CRO strategies for global clients&lt;/strong&gt; that scale across markets and languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape &lt;strong&gt;strategic plans and roadmaps&lt;/strong&gt; for key ASO clients worldwide, across multiple markets and languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combine ASO know-how with CRO principles and &lt;strong&gt;run experiments that lift app campaign conversion&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run &lt;strong&gt;keyword optimization (KWO) projects&lt;/strong&gt; that make apps easier to find, adapting the approach to each language and audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use &lt;strong&gt;creative testing&lt;/strong&gt; to sharpen app store assets so clients stand out in crowded marketplaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach Growth Managers&lt;/strong&gt; to strengthen their analytical and strategic thinking, and encourage curiosity and data-led decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and refine client strategies on a solid understanding of &lt;strong&gt;user behaviour, app store mechanics and growth experimentation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise Phiture’s profile&lt;/strong&gt; in the mobile marketing industry, especially in ASO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the &lt;strong&gt;quality of our work&lt;/strong&gt; consistently high across every client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow industry trends and best practices, and bring them into your pod’s strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years in ASO&lt;/strong&gt; or a related field (e.g. CRO, performance marketing, experiment-driven mobile growth)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grounding in &lt;strong&gt;ASO and mobile marketing&lt;/strong&gt;, particularly &lt;strong&gt;performance marketing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinking backed by proven experience in &lt;strong&gt;experimentation, hypothesis testing and user behaviour analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp research skills, critical thinking and a &lt;strong&gt;data-led approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and flexibility, with a readiness to learn the technical side of ASO if it’s new to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;client management experience in an agency&lt;/strong&gt; environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent spoken and written English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Apple Ads&lt;/strong&gt; or any &lt;strong&gt;CAC:LTV-based performance marketing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of neighbouring growth disciplines such as &lt;strong&gt;lifecycle marketing&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;funnel optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on use of &lt;strong&gt;A/B testing or experimentation tools&lt;/strong&gt; (Optimizely, Hotjar, VWO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
