&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Hybrid work setup: home office friendly with a central Madrid office location.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
