&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hunter Douglas is wereldwijd marktleider in raamdecoratie en een toonaangevende producent van architecturale producten. Wij zijn een merk dat u kent en vertrouwt. Met meer dan 100 jaar ervaring in innovatie hebben wij onze industrie mede vormgegeven met unieke producten die baanbrekend design en functionaliteit combineren. Onze producten zijn wereldwijd te vinden in miljoenen woningen en commerciële gebouwen. Wij zijn op zoek naar gedreven, intelligente, creatieve en ondernemende mensen. Door uitdagende functies en versnelde groeimogelijkheden te bieden, gedreven door een gezamenlijke ambitie om succesvol te zijn, creëren wij een omgeving waarin uw carrière zich verder kan ontwikkelen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ruil voor uw expertise bieden wij een competitief en uitgebreid arbeidsvoorwaardenpakket, zodat u zich gewaardeerd voelt voor de bijdrage die u levert.&amp;nbsp;Onze ambitie is om het snelst groeiende en meest geliefde raamdecoratiebedrijf ter wereld te worden. &lt;em&gt;Wat is uw ambitie?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager Fabrics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wil jij werken op het snijvlak van productontwikkeling, commercie en innovatie binnen raamdecoratie? En krijg je energie van het ontwikkelen van producten die wereldwijd zichtbaar zijn? Dan is dit jouw kans om als Product Manager Fabrics impact te maken binnen ons internationale Product Team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jouw rol&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Product Manager Fabrics ben je verantwoordelijk voor het ontwikkelen en beheren van onze stofcollecties voor raamdecoratie. Van het eerste idee tot de introductie in de markt en uiteindelijk de doorontwikkeling of uitfasering: jij houdt het overzicht en zorgt dat de juiste mensen op het juiste moment in beweging komen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je werkt daarbij nauw samen met collega&#39;s uit onder andere Design, Sales, Marketing, R&amp;amp;D, Procurement, Operations en Manufacturing. Je vertaalt markt- en klantinzichten naar concrete productoplossingen en zorgt dat nieuwe collecties succesvol hun weg vinden naar de Europese markt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Een veelzijdige rol dus, waarin productmanagement, projectmanagement, commercieel inzicht en data-analyse samenkomen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat ga je doen?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je beheert het fabrics-portfolio, daarbij zorg je voor correcte productspecificaties, productdata en documentatie gedurende de volledige productlevenscyclus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je leidt productontwikkelingsprojecten van concept tot marktintroductie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je brengt verschillende disciplines en stakeholders bij elkaar en bewaakt planning, voortgang, risico&#39;s en resultaten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je analyseert markt-, klant- en verkoopdata en vertaalt inzichten naar kansen voor het portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je werkt mee aan productpositionering, prijsbeslissingen en businesscases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je ondersteunt Sales en Marketing met producttrainingen, presentaties en marktintroducties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Samen met Design vertaal je marktinzichten naar commerciële uitgangspunten voor nieuwe collecties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je fungeert als productexpert voor interne en externe stakeholders en vertaalt complexe productinformatie naar duidelijke adviezen en oplossingen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je zorgt samen met Supply Chain en Operations voor een soepele introductie van nieuwe producten en een betrouwbare productbeschikbaarheid.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dit breng jij mee&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je bent een ervaren en zelfstandige professional die graag structuur brengt in complexe projecten en energie krijgt van samenwerken met verschillende disciplines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Voor deze positie zoeken we iemand met minimaal 5 jaar relevante werkervaring in bijvoorbeeld productmanagement, projectmanagement, category management of een vergelijkbare rol.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Daarnaast heb je:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een hbo diploma in bijvoorbeeld Bedrijfskunde, Marketing, Textieltechnologie of een vergelijkbare richting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sterke projectmanagement- en stakeholdermanagementvaardigheden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercieel inzicht en een klantgerichte blik.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een analytische, data-gedreven manier van werken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ervaring met het werken aan meerdere projecten en met verschillende stakeholders tegelijk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Goede beheersing van het Nederlands en Engels. Duits of een andere extra taal is een pré.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interesse in AI en de manier waarop AI kan bijdragen aan productiviteit, inzichten en bedrijfsprocessen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je bent proactief, georganiseerd en hands-on. Je houdt overzicht wanneer er veel tegelijk gebeurt, neemt eigenaarschap en bent niet bang om zelf de handen uit de mouwen te steken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Waarom deze rol?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je komt terecht bij Artex in Aarle-Rixtel, maar bent deel van het Product Team van Hunter Douglas met hoofdkantoor in Rotterdam. Hunter Douglas is een wereldwijd toonaangevende speler in raamdecoratie en architecturale producten, met meer dan 100 jaar ervaring in innovatie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In deze rol als Product Manager Fabrics werk je aan innovatieve stofoplossingen voor toonaangevende merken in raamdecoratie (zoals Luxaflex) en werk je samen met collega&#39;s uit verschillende disciplines en landen. Je krijgt daarmee een brede rol met zichtbare impact op ons productportfolio én onze klantpropositie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Klaar om jouw ervaring in te zetten voor producten die wereldwijd impact maken? Dan maken we graag kennis met je.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Door hieronder je sollicitatie in te dienen, geef je vooraf toestemming om sms-berichten te ontvangen om je op de hoogte te stellen van updates over de status van je sollicitatie en om gedurende je sollicitatieproces met je in gesprek te gaan. Je kunt de sms-service op elk moment annuleren. Stuur gewoon “STOP” als antwoord op een van onze sms-berichten om je af te melden. Er kunnen kosten voor berichten en data van toepassing zijn. De frequentie van berichten kan variëren. Als je vragen hebt over privacy, lees dan ons privacybeleid, &lt;a class=&quot;fui-Link fai-bebop ___1myvvpj f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl f16muhyy f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv f1mo0ibp fjoy568 ff5ikls f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f33ey8m f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1bwia3u f1eh06m1 f1xeumsx fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f132whgj f1v74mp6 f1tsf1ni fnq52rx f16zlvvm&quot; href=&quot;https://www.hunterdouglas.com/privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-tabster=&quot;{&amp;quot;restorer&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:1}}&quot;&gt;https://www.hunterdouglas.com/privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt; of onze gebruiksvoorwaarden &lt;a class=&quot;fui-Link fai-bebop ___1myvvpj f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl f16muhyy f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv f1mo0ibp fjoy568 ff5ikls f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f33ey8m f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1bwia3u f1eh06m1 f1xeumsx fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f132whgj f1v74mp6 f1tsf1ni fnq52rx f16zlvvm&quot; href=&quot;https://www.hunterdouglas.com/terms-of-use&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-tabster=&quot;{&amp;quot;restorer&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:1}}&quot;&gt;https://www.hunterdouglas.com/terms-of-use&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role in Our Story:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;As our Enterprise Architecture, you will play a key role in shaping ACT&#39;s technology direction as we continue to grow our global trading business and expand our digital capabilities.You&#39;ll take ownership of our enterprise architecture strategy, ensuring that our technology platforms, systems and investments work together to support business growth. Working at Group level, you&#39;ll reporting to Global IT Director and partner closely with senior leadership to influence strategic decisions, bring alignment across teams and build a scalable technology landscape for the future. In essence, your role involves:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape our enterprise architecture strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and drive a clear technology vision and roadmap across business, applications, data and technology, aligned with ACT&#39;s commercial priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive alignment across the Group:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure technology initiatives and platforms work together, reducing complexity, duplication and fragmented solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead architecture governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish principles and standards, guide key architecture decisions and challenge investments where needed to ensure long-term scalability and business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence strategic technology investments:&lt;/strong&gt; Advise senior leadership on technology priorities, platform choices and opportunities to optimise our technology landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable business and digital growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the development of integrated platforms and client-facing digital solutions, ensuring technology can scale alongside the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and develop architecture capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; Strengthen the enterprise architecture function, coach and develop expertise, and collaborate closely with engineering, data, security and business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as a strategic business partner:&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly with the COO, Global IT Director and other senior stakeholders, translating business ambitions into practical technology direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be successful in this role, we are looking for candidates with the following qualifications and attributes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Information Systems or a related field. A Master&#39;s degree in technology or business is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10–15 years of progressive experience in architecture and technology, including at least 5 years in a senior leadership position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to define and drive enterprise architecture strategy, governance and roadmaps across complex organisations, while influencing executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise across business, application, data and integration architecture, including cloud platforms, APIs and modern design patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of established frameworks and methodologies, such as TOGAF and business-capability modelling, with the ability to apply them pragmatically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of technology portfolio rationalisation, reducing complexity, identifying consolidation opportunities and optimising investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial judgment, translating technical decisions into measurable business value while balancing cost, scalability, risk and speed to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and influential leadership style, with experience building architecture capabilities, coaching teams and driving change across an organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in trading, financial services, commodities or other data-intensive, regulated environments is highly advantageous, alongside experience architecting integrated, client-facing digital platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet these criteria and are ready to contribute your expertise to a dynamic and challenging environment, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Commercial Account Executive (SCAE) on our Commercial Sales team, you will assist in Datadog’s overall business growth by strategically engaging and closing net-new customers across small to midsize markets. Sellers follow a well-defined methodology, collaborate with internal stakeholders, identify the customer&#39;s unique needs, and clearly convey the value of the Datadog product. AEs have the opportunity to grow their careers in Sales and continue contributing to Datadog team success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on net-new logo acquisition via outbound activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a Datadog expert through continued product and sales trainings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full sales cycle, including technical demonstrations and negotiations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle larger, more complex deals with longer sales cycles with autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Informally coach/ mentor other Account Executives on closing deals and more complex negotiations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales Development Representatives to drive top of funnel activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategically prospect into Chief Technology Officers, Engineering/IT Leaders, and technical end-users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a visible proponent and mentor for targeting, territory, and funnel management within the sales organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Always maintains a well balanced pipeline with an appropriate number of opportunities at each stage to maximize personal productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates superior judgment about when to &quot;walk-away&quot; from unattractive opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to navigate complex sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, driven, and motivated as a sales person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who can handle more complex sales cycles and understand how and when to bring in key stakeholders both internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a strong understanding of deal progression and development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong outbound prospecting skills including account mapping, cadences and cold calling skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to learn from feedback and champion a growth mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the required region/ market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a highly technical, fast paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Theoretical/ working knowledge of MEDDICC and COM methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in carrying quota, with a proven track record of success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years as a Commercial Account Executive within the SaaS company&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your experience, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits and Growth:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High income earning opportunities based on self performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New hire stock equity (RSU) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales training in MEDDIC and Command of the Message&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intra-departmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive company culture, opportunity to join our Community Guilds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous global benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;RDQ427R369&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Databricks, we are passionate about enabling data teams to solve the world&#39;s toughest problems — from making the next mode of transportation a reality to accelerating the development of medical breakthroughs. We do this by building and running the world&#39;s best data and AI infrastructure platform so our customers can use deep data insights to improve their business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Developer Ecosystem organisation shapes how developers and the AI agents working for them build on the Databricks Data and AI Platform, from within the product to the tools they already use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring an Engineering Manager to lead our declarative deployment framework, which turns data and AI projects into versioned, reviewable, repeatable software. It is one product with two entry points. Third-party developers use our open-source CLI from their IDEs, terminals, and CI/CD systems. First-party, they author, deploy and inspect the same projects inside the Databricks workspace. In both, AI agents increasingly do the work: coding agents drive the CLI, and our in-product AI assistant authors and deploys projects alongside the developer. Thousands of organisations run their CI/CD on it, and it is one of the fastest-growing parts of the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team owns the deployment engine and CLI, the in-workspace authoring and deployment experience, and the metadata service and deployment history that record every deployment. The hard problems are real infrastructure-as-code problems: reconciling declared and live state, making plans safe for humans and agents to approve, keeping visual authoring and code in sync, and shipping weekly releases that remain backwards-compatible for our largest customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and grow the team:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage a team of senior engineers across three closely connected areas (the deployment engine and open-source CLI, the in-workspace authoring and deployment experience, and deployment history and metadata), working with strong tech leads. Hire, coach and promote, and grow engineers into tech leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make agentic development the default path:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape how developers and AI agents author, validate and deploy projects, both inside the workspace and from the developer&#39;s own coding agent. Design the tools, skills and guardrails so agents get the same safety and auditability as humans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the strategy and roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Product and Design to set a multi-quarter roadmap for declarative deployment: agentic development, governed deployments and deployment history, enterprise CI/CD, and new resource coverage. Make the trade-offs explicit when the demand is larger than the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the bar on execution and operational excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Run a predictable delivery process for a fast-moving, open-source product with frequent releases. Own reliability, on-call health, incident response and the quality bar for a tool customers depend on to ship to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Treat backward compatibility as a product feature:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead engine and configuration migrations without forcing customers through a flag day, and communicate change clearly to customers, the community and field teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead across the platform:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive alignment with the many platform teams whose resources and services the framework deploys, and with our sibling teams in Developer Ecosystem (SDKs, CLI, IaC provider, IDE). Make the whole toolchain feel like one product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years managing software engineering teams, and 8+ years of software engineering experience overall.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building and shipping developer tools or platforms used by many external developers or internal teams, such as infrastructure-as-code, deployment or CI/CD systems, CLIs, SDKs, or internal developer platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of declarative systems and deployment workflows: plan/apply, state management, drift and reconciliation, environment promotion, GitOps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enough technical depth to engage on architecture and trade-offs with senior and staff engineers, and to hold a high-quality bar for public, versioned interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading teams through ambiguity, with competing priorities from customers, partners and platform dependencies, and making clear calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product sense and a customer-first mindset. You enjoy talking to developers, reading their issues, and turning feedback into roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication, including with executives, partner teams and an external developer community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stand-out experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built or led teams on infrastructure-as-code or deployment platforms, e.g. Terraform, Pulumi, AWS CDK / CloudFormation, Kubernetes controllers, Argo CD / Flux / Helm, or Vercel / Netlify-style deploy platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managed an open-source developer tool with an active community and a frequent release cadence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shipped developer workflows for AI coding agents (CLI-first tooling, agent skills, MCP), or AI-assisted authoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have managed managers or multiple teams (~15 to 20+ engineers), owned a multi-year platform strategy, and grown tech leads and managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
